Subject: [PATCH] stalls: no SD work on the ring thread mid-frame; the profiler report below the game

The log file gets a 64 KB stdio buffer; the remap list and the variants missing from the PC cache are
collected and written by the 10 s report; the profiler writes its report at the game threads' priority
or below, through 256 KB buffers (at 0x2A it froze the game for 2-3 s every 10 s).

---
